OL,3,GNEWSASurf life-saving club donated new
OL,4,Alife boat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA surf life-saving club has launched a
OL,7,Fnew rescue boat to "strengthen" its
OL,8,Frescue capability.
OL,10,FThe inshore rescue boat, which was
OL,11,Fdonated to Newquay Surf Life-Saving
OL,12,FClub by Gold Traders UK Ltd, would
OL,13,Fsupport year-round coastal surveillance
OL,14,Fat Fistral and training lifeguards, the
OL,15,Fclub said.
OL,17,FClub chair Simon Barnes said the boat
OL,18,Fwould "make a real difference on this
OL,19,Fcoastline for years to come".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
