OL,3,GNEWSASurf life-saving club donated new
OL,4,Alife boat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Watts, head of Gold Traders UK
OL,7,FLtd, said: "Having the right equipment
OL,8,Fcan be the difference between being
OL,9,Fable to respond to an emergency and
OL,10,Fbeing unable to reach someone in time."
